From: desocketed <desocketed@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 18:02:25 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] tests/xdiff: differential test of the SM86 lowering over the
 game's own shader forms; real instructions of every form in a shader cache's
 stored inputs are lowered with nx2navi_xlate --lower and run on random inputs
 through an SM86 reference and a Maxwell reference that decodes with the
 translator's own tables, mismatches ranked by the shaders they reach;
 selftest.py checks the checker on a transcription of the lowering and catches
 the I2F signed-flag bug of patch 0064

